Senator Smith, from the Senate Committee on Rules, reports the following bills:

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 1, by the Senate Committee on Rules, Power for Jobs extender;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 5, amends certain provisions of the New York State Financial Emergency Act;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 8, by the Senate Committee on Rules, increases the bond and note authorization;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 16, by the Senate Committee on Rules, relates to the effectiveness of the sale of bonds and notes;

And Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 25, by the Senate Committee on Rules, increases the amount of reimbursement the Division of Veterans Affairs shall provide.

All bills reported direct to third reading.

Senator Smith, from the Committee on Rules, reports the following bills:

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 2, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act to amend Chapter 352 of the Laws of 2005;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 26, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act in relation to the implementation;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 28, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act to amend the Local Finance Law;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 39, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act to amend Chapter 331 of the Laws of 2007;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 41, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act to amend Chapter 738 of the Laws of 2005;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 42, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act to amend Chapter 405 of the Laws of 2007;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 46, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act to amend the Vehicle and Traffic Law and the State Finance Law;

Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 324, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act to amend the Tax Law;

And Extraordinary Session Senate Print Number 325, by the Senate Committee on Rules, an act to amend the Tax Law.

All bills ordered direct to third reading.
